  vendorName: Contractor Rockford
  offerText: Your ceiling is structurally unsound! Pay my urgent fee, and my crew
    will rapidly reinforce it, saving you from a catastrophic physical injury.
  acceptResultText: You pay the fee. The crew does a terrible job, dropping heavy
    plaster on your head and leaving massive steel scaffolding blocking your room!
  rejectResultText: You refuse to be intimidated by his scare tactics, though you
    nervously watch the ceiling.
  acceptedDelayedText: While trying to move the scaffolding, you notice the crew
    accidentally broke open a hidden compartment in the rafters. It's full of antique
    gold coins!
  rejectedDelayedText: Rockford wasn't lying! The ceiling completely collapses, crushing
    your leg and filling your entire room with heavy, immovable debris.
